    old "\nYou wake up in a strange hospital with no memory of how you got there.\n\nThere, you meet {b}Cry Bunny{/b}, a cheerful rabbit loving nurse...\nwell, the only nurse here.\n\nBut you're not alone.\n\nTwo other patients, {b}Tilly{/b} and {b}Lucy{/b}, fill the strange hospital with color, laughter, and life.\n\nYou're promised that you'll be able to leave once you get better...\n\nWhatever that means.\n\nUntil then, why not spend some time with the other patients?\nMake some memories, get to know your silly rabbit nurse, and perhaps...\n\n{s}Uncover the secrets hidden within the hospital.{/s}\n\nCredits \n\nWritten and illustrated by:\nUbaepeachy\n\nProofreader and Editor:\nGael Min\n\nColorpicker, my lifesaver wow\n\n{a=https://feniksdev.itch.io/color-picker-for-renpy}Color Picker for Ren'Py - feniksdev{/a}\n\nSFX:\nMost effects found on Pixabay\n\n{a=https://pixabay.com/users/dragon-studio-38165424/}Dragon Studio - Pixabay{/a}\n\nTyping sounds:\n\n{a=https://github.com/aquapaulo/renpy-typewriter-sounds/tree/main}Ren'Py Typewriter Sounds{/a}\n\nMusic:\n\n{a=https://towball.itch.io/towballs-crossing}Towball's Crossing{/a}\n\n{a=https://fulminisictus.itch.io/visual-novel-audio-pack}Visual Novel Audio Pack Vol. 1{/a}\n\n{a=https://fulminisictus.itch.io/visual-novel-audio-pack-vol-2}Visual Novel Audio Pack Vol. 2{/a}\n\n\nLinks \n\nSocials\n\n{a=https://x.com/itsubaepaechy}Twitter{/a}\n\n{a=https://www.instagram.com/ubaepeach/?hl=en}Instagram{/a}\n\n{a=https://www.tiktok.com/@ubaepeach}TikTok{/a}\n\n\nSupport me \n\n{a=https://ko-fi.com/ubaepeachy}KO-FI{/a}\n\nThanks for playing\n\nMade with {a=https://www.renpy.org/}Ren'Py{/a} [renpy.version_only].\n\n[renpy.license!t]\n\n"
    new "\nGarip bir hastanede, oraya nasıl geldiğini hatırlamadan uyanıyorsun.\n\nOrada neşeli, tavşan sever bir hemşire olan {b}Cry Bunny{/b} ile tanışıyorsun...\nşey, buradaki tek hemşire.\n\nAma yalnız değilsin.\n\nDiğer iki hasta, {b}Tilly{/b} ve {b}Lucy{/b}, bu tuhaf hastaneyi renk, kahkaha ve yaşamla dolduruyor.\n\nİyileştiğinde buradan ayrılabileceğin sana vaat ediliyor...\n\nBunun ne anlama geldiği her neyse.\n\nO zamana kadar diğer hastalarla biraz vakit geçirmeye ne dersin?\nBirkaç anı biriktir, komik tavşan hemşirenle tanış ve belki de...\n\n{s}Hastanenin içinde gizlenen sırları ortaya çıkar.{/s}\n\nEmeği Geçenler \n\nYazan ve çizen:\nUbaepeachy\n\nDüzeltmen ve Editör:\nGael Min\n\nRenk seçici, hayat kurtarıcım vay\n\n{a=https://feniksdev.itch.io/color-picker-for-renpy}Color Picker for Ren'Py - feniksdev{/a}\n\nSes efektleri:\nEfektlerin çoğu Pixabay'de bulundu\n\n{a=https://pixabay.com/users/dragon-studio-38165424/}Dragon Studio - Pixabay{/a}\n\nYazı sesleri:\n\n{a=https://github.com/aquapaulo/renpy-typewriter-sounds/tree/main}Ren'Py Typewriter Sounds{/a}\n\nMüzik:\n\n{a=https://towball.itch.io/towballs-crossing}Towball's Crossing{/a}\n\n{a=https://fulminisictus.itch.io/visual-novel-audio-pack}Visual Novel Audio Pack Vol. 1{/a}\n\n{a=https://fulminisictus.itch.io/visual-novel-audio-pack-vol-2}Visual Novel Audio Pack Vol. 2{/a}\n\n\nBağlantılar \n\nSosyal Medya\n\n{a=https://x.com/itsubaepaechy}Twitter{/a}\n\n{a=https://www.instagram.com/ubaepeach/?hl=en}Instagram{/a}\n\n{a=https://www.tiktok.com/@ubaepeach}TikTok{/a}\n\n\nBeni Destekle \n\n{a=https://ko-fi.com/ubaepeachy}KO-FI{/a}\n\nOynadığın için teşekkürler\n\n{a=https://www.renpy.org/}Ren'Py{/a} [renpy.version_only] ile yapıldı.\n\n[renpy.license!t]\n\n"

